## Title: TimmyGnome
## Notes: RestedXP guide: a Gnome Mage route through Coldridge Valley, Dun Morogh, Elwynn Forest, Loch Modan, the Hall of Thanes, Darkshore, the Ruins of Lordaeron, the Deadmines, Redridge, Duskwood, the Wetlands, the Stockade, the Excavation Site and back to Duskwood, levels 1 to about 30. Needs RestedXP Guides.
